<title>RUSSIA: SOCCER-KRYLYA BEAT ROTOR TO MAKE RUSSIAN CUP SEMIS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KRYLYA BEAT ROTOR TO MAKE RUSSIAN CUP SEMIS.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Russian Cup quarter-final played on Tuesday:</p>
<p> Krylya Sovietov Samara   1   Rotor Volgograd    0</p>
<p>Playing Wednesday: Torpedo LM Moscow v Lokomotiv Moscow</p>
<p>Semifinals:</p>
<p>Dynamo Moscow v Zenit St Petersburg (May 27)</p>
<p>Krylya Sovietov Samara v Torpedo or Lokomotiv Moscow (May 28)</p>
<p>Final to be played in Moscow on June 11.</p>
</text>
